From ca072ee898b419cea314d04a8fc225ef45f5f935 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 17:33:39 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 185/187] net: airoha: offload simple OMCI VLAN translation

Preserve the customer-side and ANI-side VLAN identifiers from simple
Class 171 single-tag replacement rules. Apply the VID rewrite in the CPU
transmit path and reverse it on GPON receive when downstream inverse mode
is selected.

Program the translated ANI VID into xPON PPE FOE entries while retaining
the GEM, T-CONT, queue and NBOQ metadata selected from the customer-side
VLAN. Reject Class 171 operations that require tag stacking, removal,
priority, TPID, DEI or EtherType transformations not implemented by this
backend.

Signed-off-by: OpenAI <noreply@openai.com>
Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
